{"id":"hardfork-jensen-huang-affair-2026-11-10","title":"The Jensen Huang Affair","guest":"Stephen Witt（《The Thinking Machine》作者）","show":"Hard Fork","date":"2026-11-10","duration":"31分钟","category":"VC·基建·市场","topics":["chips-hardware","policy-geopolitics","compute-infra","markets-vc"],"priority":"P1","summary":"Hard Fork 约 31 分钟的周中特辑，邀请《The Thinking Machine》作者 Stephen Witt。节目简介称：Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang 承认与数据中心公司 Megaspeed 一名高管存在婚外关系；美方指称该人以 Alice Huang 为名、是中国间谍。简介说将梳理这一仍在发展中的事件及其对 AI 与全球经济的意味。补充阅读指向时报既有报道标题，包括 Megaspeed 与被禁芯片、Huang 被视作间谍行动目标、Nvidia 内部调查、Rubio 警告，以及商务部芯片调查一度被叫停等。长镜未独立核实这些报道；本条只转述节目简介及其列出的新闻标题，不构成事实认定或法律判断。","advice":"关心 Nvidia 治理、芯片出口管制与中美技术安全叙事的人可以听，但请注意这是刚过 30 分钟的新闻特辑，不是技术访谈，且涉及个人隐私与尚未完结的指控。建议先看简介列出的时报报道再决定是否收听。摘要仅转述 Hard Fork / 时报节目页。","urls":[{"label":"NYT Hard Fork 栏目","href":"https://www.nytimes.com/column/hard-fork"},{"label":"Audio","href":"https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/tracking.swap.fm/track/4jdbjyyrkqk96egqozqb/nyt.simplecastaudio.com/3e43d072-f8a5-430f-bc8e-4c70aafdf3c7/episodes/60b69225-e908-4027-b756-bd9474f00135/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&awCollectionId=3e43d072-f8a5-430f-bc8e-4c70aafdf3c7&awEpisodeId=60b69225-e908-4027-b756-bd9474f00135&feed=l2i9YnTd"}],"addedAt":"2026-11-10","cover":"thumbs/hardfork-jensen-huang-affair-2026-11-10.jpg","media":{"audioUrl":"https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/tracking.swap.fm/track/4jdbjyyrkqk96egqozqb/nyt.simplecastaudio.com/3e43d072-f8a5-430f-bc8e-4c70aafdf3c7/episodes/60b69225-e908-4027-b756-bd9474f00135/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&awCollectionId=3e43d072-f8a5-430f-bc8e-4c70aafdf3c7&awEpisodeId=60b69225-e908-4027-b756-bd9474f00135&feed=l2i9YnTd","audioSource":"podcast-rss"},"hasEssay":false,"hasAnalysis":false,"hasTranscript":false}
